	abstract = {Abstract             One of the themes of feminist studies in a variety of fields is the issue of male control over females, particularly over their productive and reproductive labour. Two widespread social changes---the spread of money and the spread of new ideas about fertility regulation and modern contraceptive techniques---are, we suggest, subversive of this control, and have the potential to destabilize the gender balance of power.},
